Help For Lock

Main v also reports Lock On, Dial Lock or Panel Lock when active. Lock Off is omitted. An unreadable supported lock reports Lock Unknown. Verify changes nothing.

k changes to the next lock state immediately and stays at Top Level. No q is needed. Radios with one lock cycle Lock Off, Lock On. Where both types are supported, the order is Lock Off, Dial Lock, Panel Lock. Each press reads the current state, applies the next state and announces it after radio readback. YAC commands remain available. Use main v to check the current state without changing it.

See the notes for your radio for lock coverage and exceptions.

